        "language": null,
        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>A version of this article first appeared on the Substack of &#x201c;</em><a href=\"https://whyshoulditrustyou.substack.com/p/sec-kennedy-unleash-the-kraken-on\"><em>Why Should I Trust You?</em></a><em>&#x201d;</em></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">On Tuesday, after the United States lost its measles elimination status, health secretary Robert F. Kennedy Jr. <a href=\"https://x.com/SecKennedy/status/2122787002265268390?a=e5W1v3CWi3WY7slsxAg&amp;s=20\">posted on X</a> that he wanted to stop measles from spreading in America. &#x201c;We will stop measles outbreaks, protect American families, and work to regain U.S. measles elimination status. I continue to recommend [measles, mumps, and rubella] vaccination as the most effective way to prevent measles.&#x201d;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.statnews.com/2026/11/21/rfk-jr-maha-measles-outbreak-elimination-status-promote-mmr-vaccine/?utm_campaign=rss\">Read the rest&hellip;</a></p>"
      }
